    "html":  "\u003cdiv class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan typeof=\"mw:File\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/c/cd/Pollux_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20250118011618\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"Pollux Queen\u0026#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break \" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/c/cd/Pollux_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20250118011618\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"997\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Pollux Queen\u0026#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break .jpg\" data-image-key=\"Pollux_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cb\u003eGargantuan Fist\u003c/b\u003e\nA beatiful warrior who stands out for her gigantic hand armor. Despite her dainty frame, her hits are heavy enough to destroy the earth. It is said than the arena becomes jampacked with people clamoring to see her matches.\n\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan typeof=\"mw:File\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/1/16/Pollux_S_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20250118012424\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"Pollux S Queen\u0026#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break \" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/1/16/Pollux_S_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20250118012424\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"798\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Pollux S Queen\u0026#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break .jpg\" data-image-key=\"Pollux_S_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c